{"title":"Career roadmap — Behavioural Data Analyst","role":"Behavioural Data Analyst","summary":"A Behavioural Data Analyst uses behavioural science, cognitive science, neuroscience concepts, statistics, and data analysis to understand how people think, decide, learn, interact, and behave.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Neuroscience / Cognitive Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role can exist in technology, product analytics, UX research, consumer research, education technology, healthcare, marketing, HR analytics, gaming, financial services, and behavioural research."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest career combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cognitive/Neuroscience","Statistics","Python/SQL","Behavioural Research","Experimentation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary focus","Likely opportunities"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Psychology/cognition, statistics, research methods, data analysis"},{"text":"Behavioural Data Analyst, Research Analyst, UX Research Analyst"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Experimentation, product analytics, causal inference"},{"text":"Senior Behavioural Analyst, Product/UX Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Behavioural modelling, experimentation leadership, AI"},{"text":"Behavioural Science Lead, Decision Science Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Behavioural AI, human-AI interaction, strategic analytics"},{"text":"Head of Behavioural Science, Behavioural Analytics Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Brain and behaviour foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to neuroscience"},{"text":"Cognitive psychology"},{"text":"Behavioural science"},{"text":"Human phy